{"id":"n68157-1-7","stage":2,"title":"외박 · 外宿","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n68157-1-7-1","ko":"엄마, 친구네 집에서 하루 자고 가도 돼요?","zh":"妈妈，我可以去朋友家住一晚再回来吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"친구네","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；네：表示某人一家或所属群体，如 대리네（代理家）。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구네","audio":"/audio/7252f67f4c51fd669b53.mp3"}},{"text":"집에서","meaning":"房子，窝，巢","explanation":"집：房子，窝，巢；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"1","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에서","audio":"/audio/c00afeb6cadab90f0098.mp3"}},{"text":"하루","meaning":"一天","explanation":"하루：一天。","readings":[{"term":"하루","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49315","senseId":"1","lemma":"하루","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하루","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3"}},{"text":"자고","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자고","audio":"/audio/5755a7902444d09e923d.mp3"}},{"text":"가도","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가도","audio":"/audio/b19d49f426c9e879acbe.mp3"}},{"text":"돼요?","meaning":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","explanation":"되다：可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼요","audio":"/audio/9f1cdf460348e44aca12.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"房子，窝，巢","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"人或动物为了遮寒挡暑等，进里面生活而盖的建筑物。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"621a158068fae5de","term":"하루","zh":"一天","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3","entryId":"49315","definition":"从晚上12点到第二天晚上12点的24个小时。","pronunciation":["하루"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/504513db82cdc4d1e538.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n68157-1-7-2","ko":"외박은 절대 안 돼.","zh":"绝对不行，不能在外过夜。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"외박은","meaning":"外宿，在外过夜","explanation":"외박：外宿，在外过夜；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"외박","audio":"/audio/07c71a32d64870124a19.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68157","senseId":"1","lemma":"외박","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"외박은","audio":"/audio/68166bdda06e7ea62673.mp3"}},{"text":"절대","meaning":"绝对","explanation":"절대：绝对。","readings":[{"term":"절대","audio":"/audio/0a8790a2dbe122f345a3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31701","senseId":"1","lemma":"절대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"절대","audio":"/audio/0a8790a2dbe122f345a3.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"돼.","meaning":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","explanation":"되다：某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼","audio":"/audio/9a156a11ed02d98f483a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"07c71a32d6487012","term":"외박","zh":"外宿，在外过夜","audio":"/audio/07c71a32d64870124a19.mp3","entryId":"68157","definition":"不是在自己家或固定住处，而是在其他地方睡觉。","pronunciation":["외ː박","웨ː박"]},{"id":"0a8790a2dbe122f3","term":"절대","zh":"绝对","audio":"/audio/0a8790a2dbe122f345a3.mp3","entryId":"31701","definition":"没有任何条件或制约。","pronunciation":["절때"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7866c30854f54e722c4a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.4,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=68157","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":79,"sequenceScore":2.2267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["绝对不行，不能在外过夜。","妈妈，我可以去朋友家住一晚再回来吗？","你觉得一个人学习方便吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["妈妈，我可以去朋友家住一晚再回来吗？","你觉得一个人学习方便吗？","绝对不行，不能在外过夜。"],"answer":2}]}
